# 8. User Workflow

## Step 1 — Registration

Government agencies and vendors create registration requests.

---

## Step 2 — PMDD Approval

PMDD reviews and approves valid registrations.

---

## Step 3 — Authentication

Approved users log into the platform.

---

## Step 4 — Tender Creation

Government agency creates and publishes procurement tender.

---

## Step 5 — Bid Submission

Vendor views tender and submits proposal.

---

## Step 6 — Audit Record

System stores procurement activity and timestamps.

---

## Step 7 — Bid Review

Agency reviews and evaluates submitted bids.

---

## Step 8 — Procurement Approval

Authorized ministry approver approves procurement.

---

## Step 9 — Approval Audit Record

System stores procurement approval history.

---

## Step 10 — Auditor Verification

Auditors inspect procurement records and audit logs.

---

## Step 11 — Public Transparency

Citizens can view procurement transparency information.

---

